  "verifiedRoutingConclusions": [
    "Taqeem professional rules, CMA fund valuation requirements, SAMA supervised-entity rules, SOCPA IFRS 13, PDPL and ZATCA RETT are context-specific authorities and must be purpose-routed rather than globally applied.",
